SUMMARY:Dormition panigiri\, Panagia village
LOCATION:Panagia (Chora)\, Iraklia\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The upper village of Panagia celebrates its church on 14-15 August with a vigil\, the liturgy\, and a panigiri in the church courtyard: goat and patatato cooked by the community\, wine\, and violins until late\, with boats bringing people over from Schinoussa and Naxos. Walk up from the port (30 minutes) or take the minibus.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/iraklia/#panagia-chora-dormition-panigiri-panagia-village
